    "updated_at": "2022-04-10T20:31:32Z",
    "body": "The slowdown in the python module is likely caused by pyenv. You might be able to change the pyenv configuration to have it run faster. In starship, enabling `pyenv_version_name` in the python module might help. The performance could improve once caching is implemented.\r\n\r\nGit status is expected to be somewhat slow in larger repositories. You should be able to improve performance a bit by running `git gc` and enabling `feature.manyFiles` in git.",
